{"id": "logic_006", "category": "logic", "mode": "council", "question": "Tom has twice as many apples as Sara. Sara has 3 fewer apples than Ben. Ben has 10 apples. How many apples does Tom have?", "answer": "To determine how many apples Tom has, we need to follow the relationships given in the problem step by step.\n\n1. **Ben's Apples**: Ben has 10 apples.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Ben's apples} = 10\n   \\]\n\n2. **Sara's Apples**: Sara has 3 fewer apples than Ben.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Sara's apples} = \\text{Ben's apples} - 3 = 10 - 3 = 7\n   \\]\n\n3. **Tom's Apples**: Tom has twice as many apples as Sara.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Tom's apples} = 2 \\times \\text{Sara's apples} = 2 \\times 7 = 14\n   \\]\n\nThus, Tom has \\(\\boxed{14}\\) apples.", "speaker": "qwen2.5-0.5b-worker", "correct": true, "score_method": "contains", "gold": "14", "elapsed_s": 7.3, "rss_gb": 6.63, "meta": {"rounds_trace": [{"round": 1, "agreement": 0.7697, "unanimous": true, "top1": "that", "entropy": 0.0, "opinions": [{"name": "Commander", "entropy": 3.02, "top": [["that", 0.536], ["the", 0.093], ["not", 0.07], ["given", 0.06]], "vec_idx": 4667}, {"name": "Scout-A", "entropy": 9.42, "top": [["that", 0.096], ["not", 0.039], ["the", 0.039], ["given", 0.039]], "vec_idx": 4668}, {"name": "Scout-B", "entropy": 9.37, "top": [["that", 0.104], ["not", 0.04], ["the", 0.039], ["given", 0.037]], "vec_idx": 4669}, {"name": "Worker-1", "entropy": 3.31, "top": [["that", 0.459], ["given", 0.096], ["not", 0.092], ["the", 0.083]], "vec_idx": 4670}, {"name": "Worker-2", "entropy": 2.98, "top": [["that", 0.509], ["given", 0.118], ["not", 0.107], ["the", 0.063]], "vec_idx": 4671}, {"name": "qwen2.5-0.5b-worker", "entropy": 3.4, "top": [["that", 0.341], ["Tom", 0.233], ["to", 0.093], ["Ben", 0.058]], "vec_idx": 4672}], "consensus_vec_idx": 4673, "escalation_level": 1, "perturb": {"recovered": true, "drift_cos": 0.9534, "lured_to": "that"}}], "perturb": {"recovered": true, "drift_cos": 0.9534, "lured_to": "that"}, "consen