{"id": "logic_017", "category": "logic", "mode": "council", "question": "Sam has $50. He spends 40% on food and half of what remains on a book. How much money does he have left?", "answer": "To determine how much money Sam has left, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Calculate how much Sam spends on food.\n2. Determine how much money remains after buying food.\n3. Calculate how much Sam spends on the book.\n4. Determine how much money remains after buying the book.\n\nLet's start with the first step:\n\n1. Sam spends 40% of his $50 on food.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Amount spent on food} = 0.40 \\times 50 = 20\n   \\]\n   So, the amount of money left after buying food is:\n   \\[\n   50 - 20 = 30\n   \\]\n\n2. Sam then spends half of the remaining $30 on a book.\n   \\[\n   \\text{Amount spent on the book} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 30 = 15\n   \\]\n   So, the amount of money left after buying the book is:\n   \\[\n   30 - 15 = 15\n   \\]\n\nTherefore, the amount of money Sam has left is \\(\\boxed{15}\\).", "speaker": "qwen2.5-0.5b-worker", "correct": true, "score_method": "contains", "gold": "15", "elapsed_s": 8.8, "rss_gb": 7.7, "meta": {"rounds_trace": [{"round": 1, "agreement": 0.7656, "unanimous": true, "top1": "that", "entropy": 0.01, "opinions": [{"name": "Commander", "entropy": 2.09, "top": [["that", 0.696], ["given", 0.086], ["not", 0.062], ["the", 0.037]], "vec_idx": 4709}, {"name": "Scout-A", "entropy": 8.59, "top": [["that", 0.155], ["given", 0.056], ["not", 0.047], ["the", 0.035]], "vec_idx": 4710}, {"name": "Scout-B", "entropy": 8.51, "top": [["that", 0.178], ["given", 0.051], ["not", 0.046], ["the", 0.033]], "vec_idx": 4711}, {"name": "Worker-1", "entropy": 2.16, "top": [["that", 0.667], ["given", 0.115], ["not", 0.058], ["the", 0.038]], "vec_idx": 4712}, {"name": "Worker-2", "entropy": 2.33, "top": [["that", 0.608], ["given", 0.152], ["not", 0.081], ["the", 0.035]], "vec_idx": 4713}, {"name": "qwen2.5-0.5b-worker", "entropy": 3.76, "top": [["that", 0.336], [